{"signature": "a5a9510c7ab12087c903ccc62cfc23bb9c470a2ea67ebcfe7be871420220c9af", "result": {"checks": {"check": {"scope": {"id": "check", "service": "github", "file": "data.json", "pointer": "/pull_request_comments", "field": "pr_id", "values": ["harmonygames-Games/match3d#477"]}, "matches": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_request_comments/767", "field": "pr_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#477", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#477#c_1", "pr_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#477", "author_login": "PERSON_6026_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: failure by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> ## Review failed\n> \n> The pull request is closed.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: failure by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n## Walkthrough\nAdds two new GameEvent classes and enum members for Collect & Win; CollectAndWinManager now stores start and end times and exposes total duration; UI controllers pass start/end and emit CollectAndWinStarted and CollectAndWinRewardClaimed events; AnalyticsManager logs those events; default collect color changed to \"none\".\n\n## Changes\n| Cohort / File(s) | Summary |\n|---|---|\n| **Game events: types & enum**<br>`Assets/Scripts/GameEvents/GameEvent.cs`, `Assets/Scripts/GameEvents/GameEventType.cs` | Added `CollectAndWinStarted` and `CollectAndWinRewardClaimed` GameEvent classes with public constructors and payload fields; added corresponding `GameEventType` enum members. |\n| **Collect & Win manager API & utils**<br>`Assets/Scripts/UI/CollectAndWin/CollectAndWinManager.cs` | `SetEventTime` signature changed to accept `startTime` and `endTime`; stores both times and updates end offset; added `GetTotalEventDurationInDays()` returning int. |\n| **UI controllers: time wiring & event emission**<br>`Assets/Scripts/UI/CollectAndWin/CollectAndWinMainScreenController.cs`, `Assets/Scripts/UI/CollectAndWin/CollectAndWinProgressController.cs` | Calls updated to `SetEventTime(startTime, endTime)`; on color/type change emit `CollectAndWinStarted` with duration; on reward claim emit `CollectAndWinRewardClaimed` with duration, completed stage, and reward string. |\n| **Analytics: new handlers**<br>`Assets/Scripts/Utils/AnalyticsManager.cs` | Added handlers for `CollectAndWinStarted` and `CollectAndWinRewardClaimed`; logs events `collect&win_start` (event_duration) and `collect&win_redeem` (event_duration, completed_stage, reward). |\n| **LiveOps config tweak**<br>`Assets/Scripts/LiveOps/CollectAndWin/CollectAndWinAPI.cs` | Changed initial `currentColor` in `CollectAndWinLocal` from `\"green\"` to `\"none\"`; no other logic changes. |\n\n## Sequence Diagram(s)\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n  autonumber\n  actor Player\n  participant UI as CollectAndWin UI\n  participant MGR as CollectAndWinManager\n  participant GE as GameEventsManager\n  participant AM as AnalyticsManager\n\n  Player->>UI: Open/Refresh Collect & Win\n  UI->>MGR: SetEventTime(startTime, endTime)\n  MGR-->>UI: (stores times)\n  UI->>MGR: GetTotalEventDurationInDays()\n  alt color/type changed\n    UI->>GE: SafeSendEvent(CollectAndWinStarted{event_duration})\n    GE->>AM: OnCollectAndWinStarted(...)\n    AM->>AM: Log \"collect&win_start\"\n  end\n  UI->>UI: Update UI\n```\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n  autonumber\n  actor Player\n  participant UI as CollectAndWin Progress\n  participant MGR as CollectAndWinManager\n  participant GE as GameEventsManager\n  participant AM as AnalyticsManager\n\n  Player->>UI: Claim Reward\n  UI->>MGR: GetTotalEventDurationInDays()\n  UI->>GE: SafeSendEvent(CollectAndWinRewardClaimed{event_duration, completed_stage, reward})\n  GE->>AM: OnCollectAndWinRewardClaimed(...)\n  AM->>AM: Log \"collect&win_redeem\"\n```\n\n## Estimated code review effort\n\ud83c\udfaf 3 (Moderate) | \u23f1\ufe0f ~25 minutes\n\n## Poem\n> A rabbit counts the start and end,  \n> Sends a hop when new events send.  \n> Rewards claimed, the carrots sway,  \n> Analytics notes the day.  \n> Hop on \u2014 the timeline's been penned \ud83e\udd55\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n\n\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>\ud83d\udcdc Recent review details</summary>\n\n**Configuration used**: CodeRabbit UI\n\n**Review profile**: CHILL\n\n**Plan**: Lite\n\n<details>\n<summary>\ud83d\udce5 Commits</summary>\n\nReviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between 61f574d418ef2102ba3a9f9da8704eae48605b23 and 8544a28e108d2c870f1bd5b961e235ed566830df.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>\ud83d\udcd2 Files selected for processing (3)</summary>\n\n* `Assets/Scripts/GameEvents/GameEvent.cs` (1 hunks)\n* `Assets/Scripts/GameEvents/GameEventType.cs` (1 hunks)\n* `Assets/Scripts/Utils/AnalyticsManager.cs` (2 hunks)\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@PERSON_6026_GITHUB_USERNAME help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->", "created_at": "2025-09-30T22:26:38Z", "updated_at": null}}], "records_checked": 884, "files_selected": 1, "files_completed": 1, "scan_complete": true, "errors": []}}, "files_read_this_call": 2, "sources": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "manifest_sha256": "d35cbcc83ffe5c3bc1a07052843dc96ecbc2d91630784a944b8eae8433d8c0cd", "freshness": "9d7b451a6e539599e0732e983c0b533019b0260e92ec9c372a249b6f651c5c3d"}], "scan_complete": true, "persona_filtered": false, "backend": "grouped-record-scan", "scope_note": "Exact direct fields in selected arrays. No SQL is applied. Absence/uniqueness is supported only within complete declared scopes. Manifest hashes are declared provenance, not fresh full-content hashes."}, "checksum": "a140a80494b51e6b172ff4258e24be3e3f8b9368b8c33e2aa1d5ca64f857f1cd"}